  "notes": "Warm off-white canvas (#f4f3ef) with a navy top bar and a mustard 'Enable routine' primary CTA. Step cards carry a colored left edge by step type (indigo trigger, amber conditions, teal actions, purple flow) and uppercase colored type eyebrows; each card shows a dry-run outcome pill (check = passed, play = fired, 'Not reached'/'Stopped' when the selected day fails). The branch step expands into side-by-side 'If true' (lavender) and 'Otherwise' (greyed, 'Not taken') lanes. Each step has a code/plain toggle; 'Show all code' converts the whole flow. The inspector evaluates the expression against recorded history: per-clause true/false readout and a strip of evening time slots. Dry-run panel replays the routine against each past day (test-day tabs with outcomes like Holiday, No trigger, Stopped). Token chips under the expression insert identifiers; invalid edits immediately flip the header to '1 issue' and mark every day as Error."
}
